{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20262XPyW9Ci0J1793675751.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>《璀璨之城》昨晚（2日）劇情再爆衝擊性場面！向來水火不容的王雪瑩 Kate（張曦雯 飾）與奶奶丁麗明（江美儀 飾），今集婆媳衝突全面大升級！二人由針鋒相對的口角之爭，激化成連環掌摑暴打，甚至演變成推落樓梯的生死驚險場面，張力爆燈！</p><p><p><img alt=\"35ea3a0f-7094-456a-adb6-f2b4d0865fea.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026yjr4vtsRHe1793675749.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>劇情講到，Lisa（陳煒飾）兒子AI 比賽作假的醜聞意外曝光，一向唔啱嘴形的婆媳二人隨即互相懷疑是對方走漏風聲。Kate 句句有骨狠辣反擊，儘管君少（吳卓羲飾）夾在中間試圖調和，但 Kate 一句毒舌狠嘲：「準時食藥呀奶奶，如果唔係就要返精神病院！」徹底點燃麗明的火山怒火！暴怒的麗明當場狠甩 Kate 一巴掌仍不消氣，緊接更將 Kate 壓在梳化上連環狂暴打，場面一度失控。</p><p><p><img alt=\"5529fc8b-cea2-4802-836b-b59956bbc5fb.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20260EsEjiBJx91793675751.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"6f656807-c403-407d-9eb5-e1e2320903cb.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026Up3Nvslt2c1793675751.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p>隨後，懷恨在心的 Kate 趁奶奶不備，狠心將對方一把推落樓梯！麗明送院救治後落得雙腿殘廢，然而瘋狂的她並未在兒子面前告發 Kate，反而在獨處時突然猛力扯過 Kate，貼近耳邊笑笑口冷笑，表示會將所有罪責推到孝賢（張智霖 飾）身上：「我為咗我嘅仔乜都夠膽做，你呢？」病態母愛令人毛骨悚然！</p><p><p><img alt=\"e3e47dab-66e1-4a42-bc7b-988af7f24a2c.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026lFWspaYyAN1793675749.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"0530104b-0bae-4ec9-9c2c-e559aebe8b7d.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026UkYE8pwLtk1793675750.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>江美儀將病態母親的瘋狂與執念演繹得令人頭皮發麻，而張曦雯被激至雙眼通紅卻依然氣勢凌人，二人火藥味十足的精彩對弈大獲觀眾讚賞，狂讚「婆媳飆戲火花四射」！</p><p><p><img alt=\"be30885e-8542-4f3d-a822-3bc6b8490c77.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/202659lEfSKIUp1793675750.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p><p><img alt=\"f7f85aee-8308-4708-b29c-dc3fe89a7cb9.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026TB9YkgyQWq1793675750.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>雖然劇中婆媳間劍拔弩張、殺氣騰騰，但幕後拍攝氛圍卻完全是另一個世界。Kelly（張曦雯）接受 <a href=\"http://tvb.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">tvb.com</a> 獨家訪問時笑爆，自己被美儀姐掌摑時頻頻笑場：「因為佢真係好瘋癲，我又唔怕死，成日講啲好有骨嘅說話去激佢。我哋拍嗰陣經常笑場，尤其喺梳化佢掌摑我嗰場戲，個畫面實在太搞笑，所以我成日忍唔住笑，最終監製直程叫我『唔好再笑！』」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:03:29.330937+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":692,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T04:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:24.201722+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T04:59:17.240060+00:00","content_hash":"7f9a4efa1a5188f9bd244da8c8cb055e17e95e717439adec1e00d30278791c64","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T05:03:29.330937+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}